<title>UK: Morland sets 25 mln stg debenture stock.</title>
<headline>Morland sets 25 mln stg debenture stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debenture stock</p>
<p>issue was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORLAND PLC</p>
<p> AMT    25 MLN STG    COUPON     **	  MATURITY    30.SEP.27</p>
<p> TYPE   DEBENTURE     ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S 27.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER AT 67 BP OVER GROSS REDEMPTION</p>
<p>		YIELD ON THE 8.0 PCT TREASURY STOCK 2021</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
